# Build products and generated output, not sources.  Everything here is
# regenerated by the scripts in this directory; HANDOFF.md §"Toolchain
# provenance" has the recipes (the patched `bin/tree-sitter` is a release build
# of this checkout, `bin/g2tsg` a release build of bison_flex/translate).
# Scratch from the check scripts (parse logs, corpus copies, built parsers).
# `.ch` is CARGO_HOME: cargo writes ~/.cargo/.global-cache on every build,
# which must not happen (nothing outside this directory is written), so the
# gates and recipes point CARGO_HOME here with `registry` symlinked in.
.ch/
.tsbuild/
.self/
.roundtrip/
.diff/
.e2e/
.harness/
.xmode/
.probe/
.corpus/

target/
bin/
.g2tsg/
.check/
.bc/
.ref/
.old*/
lib/
*.dylib
__pycache__/

# `tsg` writes these next to the grammar it compiles.
**/src/parser.c
**/src/grammar.json
**/src/node-types.json
**/src/tree_sitter/
